# API LOCK — Vercel 12-file hard limit

## Non-negotiable

1. **All backend logic lives under `/api`**. The browser must talk only to `/api/*`, never directly to Supabase.
2. **Maximum 12 serverless entry files** in `/api/*.js` (Vercel limit). Count only top-level handlers in `/api/` — not `/lib`, not `/scripts`.
3. **Do not create a 13th `/api/*.js` file.** Extend an existing domain handler (`?action=` / `?resource=` / method branch).
4. **Group by product domain, not by table.** One file = one domain (profile+settings together; library together; music/stream later). Never a new file for ~30 lines of CRUD.
5. Shared server code goes in `/lib/*` (not counted as API functions). Local tooling in `/scripts/*` (not counted).
6. **Secrets only in server env** (`.env`, Vercel env). Never commit them. Never put `service_role` in `public/`.
7. Frontend may call same-origin `/api/...` only. No Supabase JS SDK in the browser.

## Current API slots (keep ≤ 12)

| # | File | Responsibility |
|---|------|----------------|
| 1 | `api/auth.js` | Register / login / logout / session / health |
| 2 | `api/me.js` | Profile + settings (`?resource=profile\|settings`) |
| 3 | `api/library.js` | Likes / follows / albums / playlists (`?resource=...`) |
| 4 | `api/recommendations.js` | Home feed + mood mixes (`?resource=home\|mood`) |
| 5 | `api/billing.js` | YooKassa Premium (`?action=plans\|create\|status\|pending\|webhook`) |
| 6 | `api/telegram.js` | Bot webhook + reminders (`?action=webhook\|reminders\|set_webhook`) |
| 7–12 | **RESERVED** | Future domains only (e.g. stream / official music) — one domain per file |

When adding a feature: prefer extending slots 1–4. Open a new reserved slot only for a **new domain** that cannot fit cleanly.
